{"seq":1,"slug":"deterministic-update-loop","title":"确定性更新循环","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-replay-determinism/deterministic-sim/deterministic-update-loop","wordCount":1656,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"确定性更新循环\">确定性更新循环</h1><p>把模拟内核想成一台节拍器：它必须以一个永不浮动的步长推进，每一拍内部各子系统按一个永不变化的顺序执行。一旦节拍随机器性能忽快忽慢，或者子系统的执行序随机器调度而抖动，纯函数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>S</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>I</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f(S_t, I_t)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0785em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 就破了。这一篇只管「时间与顺序」这一块——每帧推进多少、按什么次序推进、并行如何不破坏确定性——它是确定性模拟内核的骨架，物理与随机数将填进这副骨架里。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>非确定性循环的原罪是用真实流逝时间驱动逻辑：<code>dt = now() - last</code>，让 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">dt</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span></span></span></span></span> 随帧率波动，于是同一段输入在卡顿的机器上和流畅的机器上推进出不同的物理。确定性循环把渲染时间和模拟时间彻底分离——模拟永远以固定步长 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span></span></span></span></span>（如 1/60 秒）推进，用一个累加器吸收渲染帧率的波动。设真实流逝 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>T</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span></span></span>，累加器 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span></span></span></span></span>，则每个渲染帧执行：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mo>+</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>T</mi><mo separator=\"true\">;</mo><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mtext>while </mtext><mi>A</mi><mo>≥</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>t</mi><mo>:</mo><mtext> simulate</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>A</mi><mo>−</mo><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A \\mathrel{+}= T; \\quad \\text{while } A \\ge \\Delta t: \\ \\text{simulate}(\\Delta t),\\ A \\mathrel{-}= \\Delta t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\"><span class=\"mord\">+</span></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.3669em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mpunct\">;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">while </span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">:</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">simulate</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\"><span class=\"mord\">−</span></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.3669em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>模拟步数因此只由累加的真实时间整除 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span></span></span></span></span> 决定，与机器快慢无关。下图是这套「固定步长 + 累加器 + 插值渲染」的经典结构。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[渲染帧开始] --&gt; B[累加器 += 真实流逝时间]&#10;  B --&gt; C{累加器 &gt;= 固定步长?}&#10;  C --&gt;|是| D[采集本 tick 输入]&#10;  D --&gt; E[simulate 固定步长&lt;br/&gt;子系统按固定序执行]&#10;  E --&gt; F[累加器 -= 固定步长]&#10;  F --&gt; C&#10;  C --&gt;|否| G[用余量插值渲染&lt;br/&gt;仅视觉,不影响状态]&#10;  G --&gt; A\">flowchart TD\n  A[渲染帧开始] --&gt; B[累加器 += 真实流逝时间]\n  B --&gt; C{累加器 &gt;= 固定步长?}\n  C --&gt;|是| D[采集本 tick 输入]\n  D --&gt; E[simulate 固定步长&lt;br/&gt;子系统按固定序执行]\n  E --&gt; F[累加器 -= 固定步长]\n  F --&gt; C\n  C --&gt;|否| G[用余量插值渲染&lt;br/&gt;仅视觉,不影响状态]\n  G --&gt; A</pre><p>下表对比三种循环写法，只有最后一种适合确定性。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>循环写法</th>\n<th>步长</th>\n<th>跨机器一致</th>\n<th>适用</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>可变步长</td>\n<td><code>dt = 真实流逝</code></td>\n<td>否（步长随帧率变）</td>\n<td>单机非确定性游戏</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>固定步长无累加</td>\n<td>固定但丢帧/堆积</td>\n<td>否（追帧行为不一致）</td>\n<td>玩具示例</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>固定步长 + 累加器</td>\n<td>固定，累加吸收波动</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>确定性模拟</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"固定步长-把时间从模拟里赶出去\">固定步长：把时间从模拟里赶出去</h2><p>确定性的第一刀是斩断模拟对墙上时间的依赖。模拟函数只接受固定的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span></span></span></span></span> 常量，绝不读 <code>now()</code>。渲染帧率是 144 还是 30，都不改变模拟看到的步长——快机器一个渲染帧里跑 0 或 1 步模拟并把余量用于插值，慢机器一个渲染帧里可能补跑 3 步追平。关键约束：模拟步数必须由「累加的真实时间」决定，而真实时间本身不进入状态——它只决定「跑几步」，不决定「每步算什么」。一个隐患是「死亡螺旋」：若单步模拟耗时超过 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span></span></span></span></span>，累加器越积越多、步数越来越多，恶性循环。对策是给单帧补跑步数设上限（如最多 5 步），超出就丢弃多余时间——但这个上限本身必须在所有联机端一致，否则一端丢帧、一端不丢就会分叉。</p>\n<h2 id=\"子系统执行序-固定到每一个调用点\">子系统执行序：固定到每一个调用点</h2><p>固定了步长，还要固定「一拍之内做什么、按什么顺序做」。如果 tick 内是「输入→AI→物理→触发器」，那么在每台机器、每一帧都必须严格是这个顺序，且每个子系统内部遍历实体的顺序也必须稳定。这里复用上一章的纪律：遍历实体一律按稳定的实体 ID 排序，绝不按哈希表的自然遍历序或指针地址（这正是 <a href=\"../foundations/sources-nondeterminism\">非确定性来源</a> 里的「容器层」陷阱）。新增实体的 ID 分配也必须确定——用一个随状态一起序列化的单调计数器，而不是依赖内存分配返回的地址。一个常被忽视的细节是「读写同帧」：如果子系统 A 在遍历中修改了子系统 B 即将遍历的集合，遍历快照的时机就成了隐藏输入；确定性循环通常要求「本帧读上帧的快照、写入下帧的缓冲」，即双缓冲状态，杜绝遍历期间的就地修改顺序依赖。</p>\n<h2 id=\"输入的对齐-每-tick-一份确定输入\">输入的对齐：每 tick 一份确定输入</h2><p>循环每推进一步，必须喂入一份与该 tick 严格对应的输入 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>I</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">I_t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0785em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>。这要求输入采集与模拟步解耦：渲染帧可能以 144Hz 采集硬件输入，但这些原始事件要被归并、采样成「第 t 个固定 tick 的输入」，且这个采样规则在所有端一致。在联机场景里，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>I</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">I_t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0785em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 还包含远端玩家的输入，于是「这一 tick 的输入是否齐了」成了推进的前提——这正是锁步与回滚分野的地方，由 <a href=\"../replay-lockstep/lockstep-networking\">锁步联机</a> 和 <a href=\"../replay-lockstep/rollback-netcode\">回滚网络</a> 接手。本篇只确立：模拟内核以「(状态, 本 tick 输入) → 下一状态」为单位推进，输入按 tick 编号对齐，不是按渲染帧。</p>\n<h2 id=\"确定性并行-让多线程结果可复现\">确定性并行：让多线程结果可复现</h2><p>性能逼着我们并行，但并行是确定性最危险的地带。问题不在「能不能并行」，而在「结果是否依赖线程到达顺序」。两条原则保证并行确定：其一，并行的子任务之间无共享可变状态（如把实体分块、各块独立更新无依赖项），写回时按固定分块顺序合并；其二，涉及归约（求合力、求总和）时，固定归约树的形状，而不是让各线程的局部结果以完成顺序相加——因为浮点加法不满足结合律，到达顺序一变末位就变。实践上常见做法是「并行计算、串行提交」：各线程并行算出各自分块的结果存入预分配槽位，再用主线程按固定索引顺序串行归并。这样并行只加速计算、不引入顺序依赖。若用定点数（见 <a href=\"../foundations/fixed-point-vs-float\">定点数与浮点</a>），整数加法满足结合律，并行归约的顺序压力会小很多。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>确定性循环的核心是固定步长 + 累加器：模拟只见常量 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span></span></span></span></span>，累加器吸收渲染帧率波动，步数由累加时间决定而非机器快慢。</li>\n<li>防死亡螺旋的补帧上限必须在所有联机端一致，否则丢帧策略差异即分叉。</li>\n<li>tick 内子系统执行序、实体遍历序、ID 分配必须全程固定；用双缓冲杜绝遍历期就地修改。</li>\n<li>输入按 tick 编号对齐，不按渲染帧；并行须「无共享 + 固定归约序」或「并行算、串行提交」。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读\">延伸阅读</h2><ul>\n<li>同 hub：<a href=\"deterministic-physics\">确定性物理</a>——填进这副循环骨架的物理子系统。</li>\n<li>同 hub：<a href=\"rng-determinism\">随机数确定性</a>——循环内随机调用如何保持可复现。</li>\n<li>跨 hub：<a href=\"../../game-engine-fundamentals/\">游戏引擎基础 · 游戏循环</a>——通用游戏循环，本篇是其确定性特化。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"确定性更新循环","id":"确定性更新循环"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"固定步长：把时间从模拟里赶出去","id":"固定步长-把时间从模拟里赶出去"},{"level":2,"text":"子系统执行序：固定到每一个调用点","id":"子系统执行序-固定到每一个调用点"},{"level":2,"text":"输入的对齐：每 tick 一份确定输入","id":"输入的对齐-每-tick-一份确定输入"},{"level":2,"text":"确定性并行：让多线程结果可复现","id":"确定性并行-让多线程结果可复现"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读","id":"延伸阅读"}],"prev":{"title":"定点数与浮点","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-replay-determinism/foundations/fixed-point-vs-float"},"next":{"title":"确定性物理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-replay-determinism/deterministic-sim/deterministic-physics"}}